412_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0774a21ccef0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Close up image of a jet engine blades\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/j3phyy4g/jet-engine-371412_1280.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc0774a21ccef0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/j3phyy4g/jet-engine-371412_1280.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc0774a21ccef0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 src=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/j3phyy4g/jet-engine-371412_1280.jpg?width=160\u0026amp;height=120\u0026amp;v=1dc0774a21ccef0\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003C/picture\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022info\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022heading md base-heading\u0022\u003EWhy digital marketing teams should work on defining AI foundations now\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022text base-text\u0022\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThere are lots of way you can use AI in digital marketing and website management \u2013 it is changing and will change how we manage our digital channels. In this article we talk about some of the foundations for that.\u003C/p\u003E\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C!-- Meta --\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022meta base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp class=\u0022date\u0022\u003E\u003Ctime\u003E19 Mar 2026\u003C/time\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022categories base-text\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/ai/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022AI\u0022\u003EAI\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/content-management/\u0022 rel=\u0022NOINDEX, FOLLOW\u0022 title=\u0022Content Management\u0022\u003EContent Management\u003C/a\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C!--// Meta --\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022item item-blog items-3 item_text-below text-left\u0022 data-os-animation=\u0022fadeIn\u0022 data-os-animation-delay=\u00220s\u0022 data-os-animation-duration=\u00221.2s\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022inner\u0022\u003E\n\u003Ca href=\u0022/3chillies-blog/eight-ways-to-support-brand-integrity-and-trust-on-your-website/\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022image image-opacity-100 image_hover-opacity-40\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cpicture\u003E\n\u003Csource data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/rezjxp2c/steve-johnson-hokontrhiaq-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077a60761c30\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/rezjxp2c/steve-johnson-hokontrhiaq-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077a60761c30\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 type=\u0022image/webp\u0022 width=\u0022800\u0022/\u003E\n\u003Cimg alt=\u0022Image of a close up of a twist of electrical wires\u0022 class=\u0022lazyload\u0022 data-srcset=\u0022https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/rezjxp2c/steve-johnson-hokontrhiaq-unsplash.jpg?width=800\u0026amp;height=600\u0026amp;v=1dc077a60761c30\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 1x, https://eurn-cdn-endpoint-10-10-d2agf5gpbxa5gkge.z02.azurefd.net/34be0bae2605/media/rezjxp2c/steve-johnson-hokontrhiaq-unsplash.jpg?width=1600\u0026amp;height=1200\u0026amp;v=1dc077a60761c30\u0026amp;format=webp\u0026amp;quality=75 2x\u0022 height=\u0022600\u0022 s